menu "K-Quirc QR Decoder"

    config K_QUIRC_SCRATCH_IN_PSRAM
        bool "Allocate decoder context + flood-fill scratch in PSRAM"
        default n
        help
            Routes the decoder context (~17 KB) and flood-fill scratch (64 KB)
            to PSRAM instead of internal-preferred RAM. Enable when a co-resident
            task needs the internal RAM the decoder would otherwise fragment.

    config K_QUIRC_DEBUG
        bool "Enable QR decoder debug visualization"
        default n
        help
            Shows the thresholded pixel buffer with timing pattern overlays.
            Useful for development and debugging QR detection issues.

endmenu
